      },
      "text": "This week a letter will be coming home to ask if you no longer require a paper edition of the weekly newsletter as you access it via the Prestons PS web page at www.prestons-p.schools.nsw.edu.au . This will assist the school in lowering our carbon footprint as well as reducing printing costs. We thank you for your support in this matter.",
